B.adx=new A.jS("Consulting","PROFESSIONALS","Get perspective on your next decision.","Bring your goals, assumptions and open questions into a focused consulting conversation. Use it to sharpen your search or organize the next step in a live opportunity.","Explore personal consulting",B.aot,B.anr)
B.anN=s(["Clear acquisition criteria","A realistic starting point","Questions worth asking"],t.s)
